{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/697df18f174641e8a405be87e399baf2/snapshots/634ad6192ffb4b6bb8fb51ed1821f910-00001.jpg\"/><p>河南中部山區每當被雲霧繚繞，宛如夢幻仙境。洛陽市欒川縣老君山一帶，翻滾雲海與霧氣覆蓋山巒，形成令人嘆為觀止的景觀。霧氣在高大山脊間盤旋，令連綿山脈看似漂浮天空的島嶼。</p><p></p><p>連日持續降雨後，大氣濕度偏高，產生戲劇性雲層形態。雲海配合金頂建築與蒼翠青山，構成一幅生動壯麗的自然畫卷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.682889+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:06.186956+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:01.925607+00:00","content_hash":"12551f177fba0f97852a311d6a910d287183c76fa50217c6714448309fda0bd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.682889+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}